    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "WHAT TO DO",
      "narration_text": "So if you tune a vocal for a Lyrical Literacy track, set the key and scale first. Keep the speed slow for a natural voice, and go fast only when you want the effect. Then listen all the way through. A corrector can put every note in tune. It can't make them the right notes.",
